    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: I'll bring it in for a check-up... eventually.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: '"Eventually" are those who end up walking. Ok, so I will just give you
